  "description": "meme-id: plays_uno_steals_green_cards; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a man holding Mexican flags, with text overlaying the image that reads 'plays uno' and 'steals all the green cards.' This meme uses a visual of a Mexican national in a celebratory or patriotic context to make a derogatory and racially charged analogy. The phrase 'steals all the green cards' is a direct reference to immigration policy, where 'green cards' are permanent resident visas. The meme implies that Mexicans are 'stealing' these visas, which is a harmful stereotype that aligns with anti-Latino/hispanic tropes, particularly those involving immigration status assumptions and job theft accusations. The juxtaposition of the image of a proud Mexican citizen with the text creates a hateful message that attacks Mexican immigrants and reinforces negative stereotypes about their role in the U.S. immigration system. This is a clear example of hateful content targeting a specific ethnic group based on protected characteristics, specifically nationality and ethnicity.",
